wormwood-vision-shootingstar = You see a great shooting star with a long wriggling tail.
wormwood-vision-fallingstar = The ground shakes. A distant boom. A star has fallen.
wormwood-vision-pilgrimage = Thousands of worms slither by your feet.
wormwood-vision-somethingbigger = A claw rests on your shoulder. It's the heaviest weight you've ever felt.
wormwood-vision-buzzing = You hear buzzing that drowns out all other noise. As soon as you begin to focus on it, it fades.
wormwood-vision-watched = Something peeks out from a vent. It wants you to join it.
wormwood-vision-heart = Your heart is tugged forward. You nearly fall.
wormwood-vision-dark = The lights fade. Something in the dark whispers your name.
wormwood-vision-memory = The station melts away around you. You're back home... and then back at the station, a moment later.
wormwood-vision-stars = A procession of stars overhead. Your chest tightens.
wormwood-vision-eyes = 3 glowing eyes stare at you from behind a wall.
wormwood-vision-nanotrasen = You see the whole of Nanotrasen space from a bird's eye view. It's all so small.
wormwood-vision-threeheadedsnake = A three headed snake coils around your leg, so tight that it'll never let go.
wormwood-vision-dan = You hear a phone ringing. It's promising nutritious snacks, at a reasonable price.
wormwood-vision-teo = For just a moment, you can smell lemo fruits on the wind and hear the distant call of a Hawatchi-Bird.
wormwood-vision-tiles = The tiles slowly shift out of alignment, and quickly snap back into place.
wormwood-vision-announcement = The PA speakers crackle to life and begin to repeat your name. It's a voice you recognize.
wormwood-vision-facade =  Somewhere more real is right behind the walls, all you have to do is reach out and tear through.
wormwood-vision-homeworld =  A planet is held tightly by the hands of an uncaring corporation. Loosen the grip.
wormwood-vision-reflection =  You catch a glimpse of your reflection. It doesn't notice you.
wormwood-vision-split =  You split in half, again and again, and then all at once you become whole again.
wormwood-vision-organs =  Your organs squirm in your body, swapping places and pushing on your insides.
wormwood-vision-money =  You become painfully aware of the monetary value of every object around you.
wormwood-vision-connection =  Everyone and everything around you is briefly connected by an iridescent thread. You blink and its gone.
wormwood-vision-favoritefood =  The scent of your favorite meal being cooked.
wormwood-vision-song = Far away, someone is singing.
wormwood-vision-pleebnar = You briefly feel a connection with a tiny green alien. It feels a connection with you, too.
wormwood-vision-hope = The sun is rising somewhere, warming you.
wormwood-vision-friends = You suddenly understand how much your friends have loved you all along. How could you not have realized?
wormwood-vision-friends2 = You see yourself fall over, and as you struggle to get back up you feel a dozen hands all lifting at once. You'll be okay.
wormwood-vision-everyone = You feel everyone you've ever met. They're right there behind you.
wormwood-vision-freedom = The Nanotrasen symbol, crumbling before you and opening a path.
wormwood-vision-capitalism = You envision the final collapse of capitalism. Incredible!
wormwood-vision-ants = You see millions of marching ants heading to the frontlines of a war beyond your comprehension.
wormwood-vision-yourself = You see yourself. And yourself. And yourself. And yourself. And yourself. And yourself.
wormwood-vision-voices = You hear a chorus of voices chattering about something you can't make out.
wormwood-vision-held = You're embraced by something much larger than yourself. Was it always there?
wormwood-vision-wind = Wind rushes through the halls of the station, nearly knocking you over.
wormwood-vision-nothing = You feel nothing. Absolute nothingness. And it's been beneath you all along.
wormwood-vision-angeldevil = You realize there's a little worm angel and little worm devil on your shoulders, bickering about every action you take.
wormwood-vision-leviathan = A gigantic worm wraps itself around the station... but you feel no malice from it at all.
wormwood-vision-paths = The hallways branch into hallways you've never noticed before, each one branching into even more hallways, recursively.
wormwood-vision-comfort = For a few moments, your pains fade, your worries slip from your mind, and it feels like it's all going to be okay.
wormwood-vision-dreams = You see yourself, years from now. You look content.
